OL,3,GNEWSAWaste ban after 10-day industrial
OL,4,Aestate fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has banned
OL,7,Faccess to an industrial site where a
OL,8,Flarge fire burnt for more than a week.
OL,10,FAt its height, 13 fire engines tackled
OL,11,Fthe fire at the Hathernware industrial
OL,12,Festate, off Rempstone Road in Sutton
OL,13,FBonington, near the Leicestershire
OL,14,Fborder, which started on 15 April.
OL,16,FThe cause of the blaze - which involved
OL,17,Flarge quantities of industrial waste,
OL,18,Fincluding wooden pallets, vehicles,
OL,19,Ftrailers, cylinders and tyres - remains
OL,20,Fundetermined due to the "severity of
OL,21,Fthe damage", Nottinghamshire Fire and
OL,22,FRescue said.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
