OL,3,GNEWSAWaste ban after 10-day industrial
OL,4,Aestate fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as imposing the six-month ban,
OL,7,Fwhich started on 2 September, the EA is
OL,8,Falso investigating alleged criminal
OL,9,Factivities at the site.
